    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "to write some sort of treatise against the heresy that bears the name of Miltiades, I have somehow been very doubtfully disposed toward the task up till now;",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
