    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "not that I felt any difficulty in refuting the falsehood, and in bearing my testimony to the truth, but that I was apprehensive and fearful lest I should appear to any to be adding some new word or precept to the doctrine of the Gospel of the New Testament,",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "with respect to which indeed it is not possible for one who has chosen to have his manner of life in accordance with the Gospel itself, either to add anything to it or to take away anything from it. Being recently,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "however, at Ancyra, a town of Galatia, and finding the church in Pontus greatly agitated by this new prophecy, as they call it, but which should rather be called this false prophecy,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s6",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "as shall be shown presently, I discoursed to the best of my ability, with the help of God, for many days in the church, both on these subjects and on various others which were brought under my notice by them.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s7",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And this I did in such manner that the church rejoiced and was strengthened in the truth, while the adversaries were forthwith routed, and the opponents put to grief.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s8",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And the presbyters of the place accordingly requested us to leave behind us some memorandum of the things which we alleged in opposition to the adversaries of the truth, there being present also our fellow-presbyter Zoticus Otrenus.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.s9",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "This, however, we did not; but we promised, if the Lord gave us opportunity, to write down the matters here, and send them to them with all speed.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Now the attitude of opposition which they have assumed, and this new heresy of theirs which puts them in a position of separation from the Church, had their origin in the following manner.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There is said to be a certain village called Ardaba in the Mysia, which touches Phrygia.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There, they say, one of those who had been but recently converted to the faith, a person of the name of Montanus, when Gratus was proconsul of Asia, gave the adversary entrance against himself by the excessive lust of his soul after taking the lead.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And this person was carried away in spirit; and suddenly being seized with a kind of frenzy and ecstasy, he raved, and began to speak and to utter strange things,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and to prophesy in a manner contrary to the custom of the Church, as handed down from early times and preserved thenceforward in a continuous succession.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s6",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And among those who were present on that occasion, and heard those spurious utterances, there were some who were indignant, and rebuked him as one frenzied,",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s7",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and under the power of demons, and possessed by the spirit of delusion, and agitating the multitude, and debarred him from speaking any more;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s8",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "for they were mindful of the Lord’s distinction and threatening, whereby He warned them to be on their guard vigilantly against the coming of the false prophets.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s9",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But there were others too, who, as if elated by the Holy Spirit and the prophetic gift, and not a little puffed up, and forgetting entirely the Lord’s distinction,",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s10",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "challenged the maddening and insidious and seductive spirit, being themselves cajoled and misled by him, so that there was no longer any checking him to silence.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s11",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And thus by a kind of artifice, or rather by such a process of craft, the devil having devised destruction against those who were disobedient to the Lord’s warning,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s12",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and being unworthily honoured by them, secretly excited and inflamed their minds that had already left the faith which is according to truth, in order to play the harlot with error.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s13",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For he stirred up two others also, women, and filled them with the spurious spirit, so that they too spoke in a frenzy and unseasonably, and in a strange manner,",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s14",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "like the person already mentioned, while the spirit called them happy as they rejoiced and exulted proudly at his working, and puffed them up by the magnitude of his promises;",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s15",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s15",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "while, on the other hand, at times also he condemned them skilfully and plausibly, in order that he might seem to them also to have the power of reproof.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s16",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s16",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And those few who were thus deluded were Phrygians. But the same arrogant spirit taught them to revile the Church universal under heaven,",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s17",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s17",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "because that false spirit of prophecy found neither honour from it nor entrance into it. For when the faithful throughout Asia met together often and in many places of Asia for deliberation on this subject,",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.1.s18",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.1.s18",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and subjected those novel doctrines to examination, and declared them to be spurious, and rejected them as heretical, they were in consequence of that expelled from the Church and debarred from communion.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Wherefore, since they stigmatized us as slayers of the prophets because we did not receive their loquacious prophets,—for they say that these are they whom the Lord promised to send to the people,—let them answer us in the name of God,",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and tell us, O friends, whether there is any one among those who began to speak from Montanus and the women onward that was persecuted by the Jews or put to death by the wicked?",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There is not one. Not even one of them is there who was seized and crucified for the name of Christ. No; certainly not.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Neither assuredly was there one of these women who was ever scourged in the synagogues of the Jews, or stoned.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "No; never anywhere. It is indeed by another kind of death that Montanus and Maximilla are said to have met their end.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s6",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For the report is, that by the instigation of that maddening spirit both of them hung themselves; not together indeed, but at the particular time of the death of each as the common story goes.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s7",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And thus they died, and finished their life like the traitor Judas.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s8",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Thus, also, the general report gives it that Theodotus—that astonishing person who was, so to speak, the first procurator of their so-called prophecy, and who, as if he were sometime taken up and received into the heavens,",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
