  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s9",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "fell into spurious ecstasies, and gave himself wholly over to the spirit of delusion—was at last tossed by him into the air, and met his end miserably.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s10",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "People say then that this took place in the way we have stated. But as we did not see them ourselves, we do not presume to think that we know any of these things with certainty.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.2.s11",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.2.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And it may therefore have been in this way perhaps, and perhaps in some other way, that Montanus and Theodotus and the woman mentioned above perished.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.3.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.3.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And let not the spirit of Maximilla say (as it is found in the same book of Asterius Urbanus), “I am chased like a wolf from the sheep; I am no wolf.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.3.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.3.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I am word, and spirit, and power.” But let him clearly exhibit and prove the power in the spirit.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.3.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.3.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And by the spirit let him constrain to a confession those who were present at that time for the very purpose of trying and holding converse with the talkative spirit—those men so highly reputed as men and bishops—namely,",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.3.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.3.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Zoticus of the village of Comana, and Julian of Apamea, whose mouths Themison and his followers bridled, and prevented the false and seductive spirit from being confuted by them.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.4.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.4.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And has not the falsity of this also been made manifest already? For it is now upwards of thirteen years since the woman died, and there has arisen neither a partial nor a universal war in the world.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.4.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.4.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Nay, rather there has been steady and continued peace to the Christians by the mercy of God.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.5.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.5.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But as they have been refuted in all their allegations, and are thus at a loss what to say, they try to take refuge in their martyrs.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.5.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.5.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For they say that they have many martyrs, and that this is a sure proof of the power of their so-called prophetic spirit.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.5.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.5.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But this allegation, as it seems, carries not a whit more truth with it than the others.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.5.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.5.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For indeed some of the other heresies have also a great multitude of martyrs; but yet certainly we shall not on that account agree with them, neither shall we acknowledge that they have truth in them.",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.5.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.5.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And those first heretics, who from the heresy of Marcion are called Marcionites, allege that they have a great multitude of martyrs for Christ. But yet they do not confess Christ Himself according to truth.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.6.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.6.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Hence, also, whenever those who have been called to martyrdom for the true faith by the Church happen to fall in with any of those so-called martyrs of the Phrygian heresy,",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.6.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.6.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "they always separate from them, and die without having fellowship with them, because they do not choose to give their assent to the spirit of Montanus and the women.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.6.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.6.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And that this is truly the case, and that it has actually taken place in our own times at Apamea, a town on the Mæander,",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.6.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.6.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "in the case of those who suffered martyrdom with Caius and Alexander, natives of Eumenia, is clear to all.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.7",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "As I found these things in a certain writing of theirs directed against the writing of our brother Alcibiades, in which he proves the impropriety of a prophet’s speaking in ecstasy, I made an abridgment of that work.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.8.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.8.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But the false prophet falls into a spurious ecstasy, which is accompanied by a want of all shame and fear.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.8.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.8.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For beginning with a voluntary (designed) rudeness, he ends with an involuntary madness of soul, as has been already stated.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.8.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.8.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But they will never be able to show that any one of the Old Testament prophets, or any one of the New, was carried away in spirit after this fashion.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.8.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.8.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Nor will they be able to boast that Agabus, or Judas, or Silas, or the daughters of Philip, or the woman Ammia in Philadelphia,",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.8.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.8.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "or Quadratus, or indeed any of the others who do not in any respect belong to them, were moved in this way.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.9.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.9.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For if, after Quadratus and the woman Ammia in Philadelphia, as they say, the women who attached themselves to Montanus succeeded to the gift of prophecy, let them show us which of them thus succeeded Montanus and his women.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.9.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.9.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For the apostle deems that the gift of prophecy should abide in all the Church up to the time of the final advent.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 192,
    "date_range": [
      190,
      195
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists#AntiMont.9.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/anonymous-against-the-montanists",
    "canonical_ref": "AntiMont.9.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But they will not be able to show the gift to be in their possession even at the present time, which is the fourteenth year only from the death of Maximilla.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
